WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.677
Temperature reshapes the token probability distribution before sampling.

00:00:04.677 --> 00:00:13.617
Lower values make high-probability tokens more dominant, while higher values flatten the distribution and allow more

00:00:13.617 --> 00:00:18.772
variation. Temperature changes selection behavior, not what the model has learned.

00:00:18.772 --> 00:00:22.732
At a low temperature, the distribution becomes sharper.

00:00:22.732 --> 00:00:29.811
At a high temperature, smaller candidates receive more relative probability and are more likely to be sampled.
